  {
    "__EMPTY": "This sheet shows the percentage of risks which relate to each of our causal factors (e.g., entity, intention and timing), and how these overlap with domains. For instance, the extent to which the risk 'Exposure to toxic content' was presented as i) Human or AI caused, ii) intentional or unintentional, or iii) occuring pre- or post-deployment. You can see specific risks catagorisation by filtering our AI risk database. For more see detail please see our report.",
